---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import company from '../data/company.json';
---
<Legal title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility statement for reef.support: built to WCAG 2.2 level AA, with keyboard support, sufficient contrast and reduced-motion support." updated="19 November 2026">
  <p>We want everyone to be able to use this website. It is built to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA, and we test it with automated checks and by hand at phone and desktop widths.</p>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Text and background colours meet AA contrast ratios.</li>
    <li>Every page works with a keyboard, with a visible focus ring and a skip link to the main content.</li>
    <li>Pages use headings, landmarks and labelled forms so screen readers can move around them.</li>
    <li>Animations are short or can be paused, and stop when your device asks for reduced motion.</li>
    <li>Layouts work from 360 px wide screens upward without sideways scrolling.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Known limitations</h2>
  <p>Photos and video are still being added. Each will get a text alternative, and video will have no sound or will carry captions.</p>
  <h2>Report a problem</h2>
  <p>If something on this site does not work for you, email <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a> with the page and what went wrong. We aim to reply within five working days.</p>
</Legal>
